msgid "\nWHO ASKS -- a proposal, and nothing is set from it"
msgstr "\nNANI ANAULIZA -- pendekezo, na hakuna kinachowekwa kutokana nalo"

msgid "  %-20s %s speaking, %s of %s sentences a question"
msgstr "  %-20s %s ya kuzungumza, %s kati ya sentensi %s ni maswali"

msgid "  The order carries, the distance between them does not: measured over four episodes it never turned round, while the distance between first and last changed fourfold. It takes one voice per track; where two of them carry the same speech nothing is said at all."
msgstr "  Mpangilio unaaminika, umbali kati yao hauaminiki: ukipimwa katika vipindi vinne haukuwahi kugeuka, ilhali umbali kati ya wa kwanza na wa mwisho ulibadilika mara nne. Inahitaji sauti ya mtu mmoja kwa kila treki; pale mbili kati ya hizo zinapobeba usemi uleule hakuna kinachosemwa kabisa."

msgid "  Who asks -- not said here: two of the tracks carry the same speech, so the questions would go to whichever recorder was turned up loudest."
msgstr "  Nani anauliza -- haisemwi hapa: treki mbili zinabeba usemi uleule, kwa hiyo maswali yangeenda kwa kinasa sauti chochote kilichowekwa kwa sauti ya juu zaidi."

msgid "\nWHICH MICROPHONE -- a proposal, and nothing is set from it"
msgstr "\nMAIKROFONI IPI -- pendekezo, na hakuna kinachowekwa kutokana nalo"

msgid "  %-20s sounds like %-20s %s %% of it inside that track, %s points ahead of the next"
msgstr "  %-20s inasikika kama %-20s %s %% yake ndani ya treki hiyo, pointi %s mbele ya inayofuata"

msgid "  It holds under one assumption: one microphone per person, and each of them carrying only that person. Where the tracks overlap too much to be told apart, or two voices point at the same microphone, nothing is said at all rather than something uncertain."
msgstr "  Hili linashikilia kwa dhana moja: maikrofoni moja kwa kila mtu, na kila moja ikibeba mtu huyo tu. Pale treki zinapoingiliana sana kiasi cha kutotofautishwa, au sauti mbili zinapoelekeza kwa maikrofoni ileile, hakuna kinachosemwa kabisa badala ya kitu kisicho na uhakika."

