msgstr "Kwa nini uendeshaji hauwezi kuanza"

msgid "Cannot start yet: %s"
msgstr "Haiwezi kuanza bado: %s"

msgid "Change rejected: %s"
msgstr "Badiliko limekataliwa: %s"

msgid "Check again"
msgstr "Kagua tena"

msgid "Check the connection to Resolve again"
msgstr "Kagua tena muunganisho na Resolve"

msgid "Check itself failed: %s"
msgstr "Ukaguzi wenyewe umeshindwa: %s"

msgid "Check the key and fetch Presets."
msgstr "Kagua ufunguo na ulete mipangilio awali."

msgid "Chosen"
msgstr "Chaguo"

msgid "Clock %7.2f%s | B1[%s] %s | B2[%s] %s | Audio %s %s"
msgstr "Saa %7.2f%s | B1[%s] %s | B2[%s] %s | Sauti %s %s"

msgid "Close"
msgstr "Funga"

msgid "Connects to Resolve again."
msgstr "Huunganisha tena na Resolve."

msgid "Content: a camera like any other.\nWide shot: a camera nobody sits in front of -- it takes no speaker, and the cut goes to it in a pause and in a long monologue.\nIntro and outro are finished clips -- not aligned, not processed, only placed in the Timeline.\nIgnore video: the file stays out entirely."
msgstr "Maudhui: kamera kama nyingine yoyote.\nPicha pana: kamera ambayo hakuna anayekaa mbele yake -- haichukui mzungumzaji, na mkato huenda kwake wakati wa pengo na wakati wa monolojia ndefu.\nUtangulizi na hitimisho ni klipu zilizokamilika -- hazipangwi sawa, hazichakatwi, zinawekwa tu kwenye Timeline.\nPuuza video hii: faili inaachwa nje kabisa."

msgid "  %s wide shots: the cut uses %s."
msgstr "  Picha pana %s: mkato unatumia %s."

msgid "  Every camera carries a speaker, so there is no wide shot: the four wide shot settings and the tick for the edges do nothing here."
msgstr "  Kila kamera ina mzungumzaji, kwa hiyo hakuna picha pana: mipangilio minne ya picha pana na alama ya tiki ya kingo havifanyi chochote hapa."

msgid "No camera is free of speakers, so there is no wide shot: the four wide shot settings and the tick for the edges do nothing. Give a camera the Kind \"Wide shot\", or leave one without a speaker."
msgstr "Hakuna kamera isiyo na mzungumzaji, kwa hiyo hakuna picha pana: mipangilio minne ya picha pana na alama ya tiki ya kingo havifanyi chochote. Ipe kamera moja Aina \"Picha pana\", au iache moja bila mzungumzaji."

msgid "placed by phase, sharpness %s against a floor of %s, drift unknown"
msgstr "imewekwa kwa fazi, ukali %s dhidi ya kiwango cha chini cha %s, mkengeuko haujulikani"

msgid "placed on the bands that move"
msgstr "imewekwa kwa bendi za masafa zinazosogea"

msgid "Why the wide shot settings are grey"
msgstr "Kwa nini mipangilio ya picha pana ni kijivu"

msgid "because no speaker is assigned to it"
msgstr "kwa sababu haijagawiwa mzungumzaji"

msgid "marked as the wide shot -- it takes no speakers"
msgstr "imewekwa alama kama picha pana -- haichukui wazungumzaji"

msgid "no speaker is assigned to it, but the cut uses %s"
msgstr "haijagawiwa mzungumzaji, lakini mkato unatumia %s"

msgid "the cut uses %s"
msgstr "mkato unatumia %s"

msgid "Curve and colour space are missing from the file"
msgstr "Mkunjo na nafasi ya rangi havipo kwenye faili"

msgid "In point and Out point are available once the time axis is set -- from the timecode or measured."
msgstr "Alama ya kuingia na alama ya kutoka zinapatikana mara mhimili wa muda unapowekwa -- kutoka timecode au kwa kupimwa."

msgid "In point is %s before the first frame"
msgstr "Alama ya kuingia iko %s kabla ya fremu ya kwanza"

msgid "In point is now %s, but the existing files belong to %s.\n  The audio in the videos is cut to the old window -- press Start\n  above again."
msgstr "Alama ya kuingia sasa ni %s, lakini faili zilizopo ni za %s.\n  Sauti katika video imekatwa kwa masafa ya zamani -- bonyeza Anza\n  hapo juu tena."

msgid "Out point is %s after the last frame"
msgstr "Alama ya kutoka iko %s baada ya fremu ya mwisho"

msgid "Out point is now %s; the window would be %s long, the existing\n  files are %s -- press Start above again."
msgstr "Alama ya kutoka sasa ni %s; masafa yangekuwa na urefu wa %s, faili\n  zilizopo ni %s -- bonyeza Anza hapo juu tena."

msgid "Delivery usually takes the limited range. Full is not wrong, but some players misread it."
msgstr "Uwasilishaji kwa kawaida hutumia masafa yenye mipaka. Full si kosa, lakini baadhi ya vicheza huyasoma vibaya."

msgid "Determines how auphonic.com processes the audio.\n\n\"%s\" leaves the key in place and still does not go there.\nThe audio is then only merged and normalised, not unmixed --\nand without separate tracks there is no camera cut."
msgstr "Huamua jinsi auphonic.com inavyochakata sauti.\n\n\"%s\" huacha ufunguo mahali pake na bado haiendi huko.\nKisha sauti inaunganishwa na kurekebishwa kiwango tu, haitenganishwi --\nna bila treki tofauti hakuna mkato wa kamera."

msgid "Distance to mean"
msgstr "Umbali kutoka wastani"

msgid "Drag audio and video files here"
msgstr "Buruta faili za sauti na video hapa"

msgid "Dry run: only measuring, nothing written, nothing uploaded."
msgstr "Jaribio: kupima tu, hakuna kinachoandikwa, hakuna kinachopakiwa."

msgid "During greeting and farewell the picture stays wide."
msgstr "Wakati wa salamu na kuagana picha inabaki pana."

msgid "The frames stand a little longer; the file is not any shorter for it. Editing software repeats about one frame every %s s, and picture and camera audio stay together."
msgstr "Fremu zinakaa muda kidogo zaidi; faili haiwi fupi zaidi kwa sababu hiyo. Programu ya kuhariri hurudia takriban fremu moja kila %s s, na picha na sauti ya kamera zinabaki pamoja."

msgid "The frames stand a little shorter; the file is not any longer for it. Editing software leaves out about one frame every %s s, and picture and camera audio stay together."
msgstr "Fremu zinakaa muda mfupi kidogo; faili haiwi ndefu zaidi kwa sababu hiyo. Programu ya kuhariri huacha takriban fremu moja kila %s s, na picha na sauti ya kamera zinabaki pamoja."

msgid "Eight bits are not enough for HDR: every gradient bands, and YouTube requires ten or twelve."
msgstr "Biti nane hazitoshi kwa HDR: kila mpito wa rangi unaonyesha mikanda, na YouTube inahitaji kumi au kumi na mbili."

msgid "Envelope"
msgstr "Mkunjo wa sauti"

msgid "  %s is placed on %s, which is no camera of this run -- the cut names it all the same."
msgstr "  %s amewekwa kwenye %s, ambayo si kamera ya uendeshaji huu -- mkato unaitaja hata hivyo."

msgid "Envelope failed: %s"
msgstr "Mkunjo wa sauti umeshindwa: %s"

msgid "Envelopes and camera audio are prepared in the background."
msgstr "Mikunjo ya sauti na sauti ya kamera vinaandaliwa chinichini."

msgid "Every row needs a name -- at Auphonic it becomes the track ID."
msgstr "Kila safu inahitaji jina -- kwenye Auphonic linakuwa track ID."

msgid "External preview -- the app does not know this format"
msgstr "Hakiki ya nje -- programu haijui muundo huu"

msgid "Fetching audio"
msgstr "Kuleta sauti"

msgid "Fetching audio ..."
msgstr "Kuleta sauti ..."

msgid "File"
msgstr "Faili"

msgid "Files are missing there -- without a new upload nothing can be computed.\n  With --auphonic-resume upload the script uploads again; this costs credit."
msgstr "Faili zinakosekana huko -- bila upakiaji mpya hakuna kinachoweza kukokotolewa.\n  Kwa --auphonic-resume upload skripti inapakia tena; hii inagharimu salio."

msgid "For HDR the usual choice is HEVC (Main 10), AV1 or VP9 Profile 2. YouTube takes H.264 too, but it needs more bitrate."
msgstr "Kwa HDR chaguo la kawaida ni HEVC (Main 10), AV1 au VP9 Profile 2. YouTube inakubali H.264 pia, lakini inahitaji kiwango kikubwa zaidi cha biti."

msgid "For ten bits HEVC needs the Main 10 profile. In Resolve it sits under Deliver as \"Profile\"."
msgstr "Kwa biti kumi HEVC inahitaji wasifu wa Main 10. Katika Resolve uko chini ya Deliver kama \"Profile\"."

msgid "%s fps, not the %s in the file -- %s fewer frames in the same length."
msgstr "%s fps, si %s zilizo kwenye faili -- fremu %s chache zaidi kwa urefu uleule."

msgid "%s fps, not the %s in the file -- %s more frames in the same length."
msgstr "%s fps, si %s zilizo kwenye faili -- fremu %s zaidi kwa urefu uleule."

msgid "Frame spacing varies by %s %% -- the frame timing is uneven."
msgstr "Nafasi kati ya fremu inatofautiana kwa %s %% -- muda wa fremu hauko sawa."

msgid "Free space there: %s"
msgstr "Nafasi iliyo wazi huko: %s"

msgid "Gap of %s between block %d and %d -- the camera stopped."
msgstr "Pengo la %s kati ya bloku %d na %d -- kamera ilisimama."

msgid "Drag to move the position."
msgstr "Buruta ili kusogeza mahali."

msgid "HDR needs 16 here (PQ, that is HDR10) or 18 (HLG). In Resolve: Gamma tag = ST.2084 or HLG. 14 is not an HDR curve but SDR in the BT.2020 space."
msgstr "Kwa HDR, hapa panahitajika 16 (PQ, yaani HDR10) au 18 (HLG). Katika Resolve: Gamma tag = ST.2084 au HLG. 14 si mkunjo wa HDR bali ni SDR katika nafasi ya BT.2020."

msgid "HDR needs 9 here (BT.2020). In Resolve: Color space tag = Rec.2020."
msgstr "Kwa HDR, hapa panahitajika 9 (BT.2020). Katika Resolve: Color space tag = Rec.2020."

msgid "HDR needs 9 here (BT.2020, non-constant luminance)."
msgstr "Kwa HDR, hapa panahitajika 9 (BT.2020, mwangaza usio thabiti)."

msgid "HLG is display-referred -- it has no entry for the mastering display."
msgstr "HLG hurejelea skrini (display-referred) -- haina kipengele cha skrini ya mastering."

msgid "If empty: next to each video file."
msgstr "Ikiwa tupu: kando ya kila faili ya video."

msgid "It arose during the recording and cannot be changed now. The less the microphones are separated, the more cautiously De-Bleed at auphonic.com can work. Next time: three times as far from the neighbouring microphone as from your own mouth, then the neighbouring voice sits about %s dB lower."
msgstr "Hili lilitokea wakati wa kurekodi na haliwezi kubadilishwa sasa. Kadiri maikrofoni zinavyotenganishwa kidogo, ndivyo De-Bleed katika auphonic.com inavyoweza kufanya kazi kwa tahadhari zaidi. Wakati ujao: mara tatu mbali zaidi na maikrofoni ya jirani kuliko na mdomo wako mwenyewe, basi sauti ya mtu jirani itakuwa chini kwa takriban %s dB."

msgid "%s fits nothing in the material, so it cannot be cut into the episode: set to Intro."
msgstr "Faili %s haiendani na chochote katika nyenzo, kwa hivyo haiwezi kukatwa ndani ya kipindi: imewekwa kuwa Utangulizi."

msgid "%s fits nothing in the material either, and the intro is taken: left out."
msgstr "Faili %s nayo haiendani na chochote katika nyenzo, na Utangulizi tayari umechukuliwa: imeachwa nje."

msgid "%s is already set as %s, and an episode has one of those. Answer differently here, or take the mark off that file first."
msgstr "Faili %s tayari imewekwa kuwa %s, na kipindi kina kimoja tu cha aina hiyo. Jibu tofauti hapa, au kwanza ondoa alama kwenye faili hiyo."

msgid "It is in the logs atom of the picture description -- that is how Resolve recognises the input colour space. Different curves mean different input colour spaces."
msgstr "Iko katika atomu ya logs ya maelezo ya picha -- hivyo ndivyo Resolve inavyotambua nafasi ya rangi ya ingizo. Mikunjo tofauti inamaanisha nafasi tofauti za rangi ya ingizo."

msgid "Jumps to the end of the window."
msgstr "Huruka hadi mwisho wa masafa ya muda."

msgid "Jumps to the start of the window."
msgstr "Huruka hadi mwanzo wa masafa ya muda."

msgid "Keychain"
msgstr "Keychain"

msgid "Limits the de-bleed: "
msgstr "Hupunguza uwezo wa De-Bleed: "

msgid "Load Presets and pick one, or leave the API Key empty."
msgstr "Leta mipangilio awali kisha uchague mmoja, au uache ufunguo wa API tupu."

msgid "Main10 rejected -- the default stays"
msgstr "Main10 imekataliwa -- chaguo-msingi linabaki"

msgid "Measure only -- nothing is written or uploaded."
msgstr "Kupima tu -- hakuna kinachoandikwa wala kupakiwa."

msgid "Measuring %s (%s of %s)"
msgstr "Kupima %s (%s kati ya %s)"

msgid "Measuring not possible: %s"
msgstr "Kupima hakuwezekani: %s"

msgid "Measuring the yardstick"
msgstr "Kupima kipimo"

msgid "Measuring time axis ..."
msgstr "Kupima mhimili wa muda ..."

msgid "Missing audio %s filled with silence%s"
msgstr "Sauti inayokosekana %s imejazwa kimya%s"

msgid "Module DaVinciResolveScript cannot be loaded: %s"
msgstr "Moduli DaVinciResolveScript haiwezi kuingizwa: %s"

msgid "One audio track per person, kept apart all the way to auphonic.com.\nWorks without it as well -- then without de-bleed and leveler.\nIt needs two input tracks: a recording of its own, a channel of a\nmultichannel recorder, or the audio of a video file set to \"use\nthe audio\". The camera cut does not need this tick."
msgstr "Treki moja ya sauti kwa kila mtu, zikiwa tofauti hadi auphonic.com.\nInafanya kazi pia bila hiki -- basi bila De-Bleed na Leveler.\nInahitaji treki mbili za ingizo: rekodi tofauti, chaneli ya\nkinasa sauti cha chaneli nyingi, au sauti ya faili ya video iliyowekwa \"tumia\nsauti ya ndani\". Mkato wa kamera hauhitaji alama hii ya tiki."

msgid "Multitrack (one track per speaker)"
msgstr "Multitrack (treki moja kwa mzungumzaji)"

msgid "Multitrack needs at least two input tracks. A track is a recording of its own, a channel of a multichannel recorder, or the audio of a video file set to \"use internal audio\". Several blocks of the same recording count as one, tracks set aside not at all."
msgstr "Multitrack inahitaji angalau treki mbili za ingizo. Treki ni rekodi tofauti, chaneli ya kinasa sauti cha chaneli nyingi, au sauti ya faili ya video iliyowekwa \"tumia sauti ya ndani\". Bloku kadhaa za rekodi moja huhesabiwa kuwa moja, na treki zilizowekwa kando hazihesabiwi kabisa."

msgid "No API key. Set AUPHONIC_TOKEN or have it remembered once in the interface. The key is in the Auphonic account settings."
msgstr "Hakuna ufunguo wa API. Weka AUPHONIC_TOKEN au uuhifadhi mara moja kwenye kiolesura. Ufunguo uko katika mipangilio ya akaunti ya Auphonic."

msgid "No audio file carries a timecode. In point and Out point count from the start of the material -- the position of the files to each other is measured."
msgstr "Hakuna faili ya sauti yenye timecode. Alama ya kuingia na alama ya kutoka huhesabiwa kuanzia mwanzo wa nyenzo -- nafasi ya faili kati yao hupimwa."

msgid "No sound in use yet -- add an audio recording, or set a video file's Camera audio to \"use internal audio\" in the file list."
msgstr "Bado hakuna sauti inayotumika -- ongeza rekodi ya sauti, au weka Sauti ya kamera ya faili ya video kuwa \"tumia sauti ya ndani\" katika orodha ya faili."

msgid "No audio tracks are assigned."
msgstr "Hakuna treki za sauti zilizogawiwa."

msgid "No camera is assigned, so there is nothing to cut between."
msgstr "Hakuna kamera iliyogawiwa, kwa hivyo hakuna cha kukata kati ya kamera."

msgid "No cameras assigned yet -- switch Multitrack on to do that."
msgstr "Bado hakuna kamera zilizogawiwa -- washa Multitrack ili kufanya hivyo."

msgid "No connection to Resolve.\n  Is the program running? Is external scripting set to 'Local'\n  under Preferences > System > General?"
msgstr "Hakuna muunganisho na Resolve.\n  Je, programu inaendeshwa? Je, skripti za nje zimewekwa kuwa 'Local'\n  chini ya Preferences > System > General?"

msgid "No files or project opened yet."
msgstr "Bado hakuna faili wala mradi uliofunguliwa."

msgid "No files selected yet."
msgstr "Bado hakuna faili zilizochaguliwa."

msgid "No input possible. Use %s %s to set what should happen."
msgstr "Hakuna ingizo linalowezekana. Tumia %s %s kuweka kinachopaswa kutokea."

msgid "No player is built in here -- playback runs in ffplay in its own window."
msgstr "Hakuna kicheza kilichojengwa ndani hapa -- uchezaji unafanyika katika ffplay kwenye dirisha lake."

msgid "No preset given, no input possible. Choose one of the above with --auphonic-preset NAME."
msgstr "Hakuna mpangilio awali uliotolewa, hakuna ingizo linalowezekana. Chagua mmoja kati ya iliyo hapo juu kwa --auphonic-preset NAME."

msgid "No presets stored in the account. One can be created in the web interface."
msgstr "Hakuna mipangilio awali iliyohifadhiwa kwenye akaunti. Mmoja unaweza kuundwa kwenye kiolesura cha wavuti."

msgid "No speaker is known here -- without who speaks when there is nothing to cut between."
msgstr "Hakuna mzungumzaji anayejulikana hapa -- bila nani anazungumza lini hakuna cha kukata kati yao."

msgid "No voice has a camera yet -- with that every shot would be the same one."
msgstr "Bado hakuna sauti ya mtu yenye kamera -- hivyo kila kipande kingekuwa kilekile."

msgid "No speakers known yet -- nothing measured, nothing separated, and no handover file of an earlier run in %s or its subfolders."
msgstr "Bado hakuna wazungumzaji wanaojulikana -- hakuna kilichopimwa, hakuna kilichotenganishwa, na hakuna faili ya makabidhiano ya uendeshaji wa awali katika %s wala folda zake ndogo."

msgid "Not found again after import: %s"
msgstr "Haikupatikana tena baada ya kuingiza: %s"

msgid "from ffmpeg.org, and the folder into PATH"
msgstr "kutoka ffmpeg.org, na folda iwekwe kwenye PATH"

msgid "over the package manager: apt install ffmpeg, dnf install ffmpeg"
msgstr "kupitia kidhibiti cha vifurushi: apt install ffmpeg, dnf install ffmpeg"

msgid "Here: %s. Needed: %s or newer."
msgstr "Hapa: %s. Inahitajika: %s au jipya zaidi."

msgid "no answer"
msgstr "hakuna jibu"

msgid "Nothing runs until that is put right."
msgstr "Hakuna kinachoendeshwa hadi hilo lirekebishwe."

msgid "Nothing runs until that is put right. This way: %s"
msgstr "Hakuna kinachoendeshwa hadi hilo lirekebishwe. Hivi: %s"

msgid "Get it: %s"
msgstr "Ipate: %s"

msgid "Quit"
msgstr "Ondoka"

msgid "That worked."
msgstr "Imefanikiwa."

msgid "Installing ffmpeg"
msgstr "Kusakinisha ffmpeg"

msgid "Start the program again to pick it up."
msgstr "Anzisha programu upya ili iitumie."

msgid "Getting it takes a few minutes, and what it says appears under Output."
msgstr "Kuipata huchukua dakika chache, na inachosema huonekana chini ya Towe."

msgid "This takes a few minutes -- a package manager may build from source. What it says appears here."
msgstr "Hii huchukua dakika chache -- kidhibiti cha vifurushi kinaweza kujenga kutoka msimbo chanzo. Inachosema huonekana hapa."

msgid "Now it is being compiled, and that is the long part: minutes on a fast machine and a good deal longer on an older one. Nothing is stuck -- a dot appears every few seconds for as long as it works."
msgstr "Sasa inakusanywa, na hiyo ndiyo sehemu ndefu: dakika kadhaa kwenye kompyuta yenye kasi na muda mrefu zaidi kwenye ya zamani. Hakuna kilichokwama -- nukta huonekana kila baada ya sekunde chache maadamu inaendelea kufanya kazi."

msgid "ffmpeg is in place."
msgstr "ffmpeg iko tayari."

msgid "The program reads it when it starts. It can start again now, or you can do that yourself later."
msgstr "Programu huisoma inapoanza. Inaweza kuanza upya sasa, au unaweza kufanya hivyo mwenyewe baadaye."

msgid "Start again now"
msgstr "Anzisha upya sasa"

msgid "Starting again did not work. Close the window and start the program the way you did before."
msgstr "Kuanzisha upya hakukufanikiwa. Funga dirisha na uanzishe programu kama ulivyofanya awali."

msgid "  Taking the ffmpeg that is there out of the way first: %s"
msgstr "  Kwanza kuondoa njiani ffmpeg iliyopo: %s"

msgid "  A built ffmpeg 9.0.1 with soxr can be fetched: %s"
msgstr "  ffmpeg 9.0.1 iliyojengwa tayari yenye soxr inaweza kuletwa: %s"

msgid "  Fetch it now? [Y/n] "
msgstr "  Ilete sasa? [Y/n] "

msgid "  Fetching a built ffmpeg. It is a big one, so this takes a few minutes: %s"
msgstr "  Kuleta ffmpeg iliyojengwa tayari. Ni kubwa, kwa hivyo hii huchukua dakika chache: %s"

msgid "  %s of %s MB"
msgstr "  %s kati ya %s MB"

msgid "The build could not be fetched: %s"
msgstr "Kifurushi kilichojengwa hakikuweza kuletwa: %s"

msgid "  The build could not be unpacked: %s"
msgstr "  Kifurushi kilichojengwa hakikuweza kufunguliwa: %s"

msgid "  The archive held %s of the two programs."
msgstr "  Jalada lilikuwa na %s kati ya programu mbili."

msgid "  It is here: %s"
msgstr "  Iko hapa: %s"

msgid "install Homebrew from brew.sh, then this again"
msgstr "sakinisha Homebrew kutoka brew.sh, kisha hii tena"

msgid "This ffmpeg has soxr: the clock drift between cameras comes out in steps of 0.21 ppm."
msgstr "ffmpeg hii ina soxr: mkengeuko wa saa kati ya kamera hurekebishwa kwa hatua za 0.21 ppm."

msgid "This ffmpeg has no soxr: the clock drift between cameras comes out in steps of 21 ppm instead of 0.21."
msgstr "ffmpeg hii haina soxr: mkengeuko wa saa kati ya kamera hurekebishwa kwa hatua za 21 ppm badala ya 0.21."

msgid "Everything works without it. Getting a build that has it takes a few minutes, and what it says appears under Output."
msgstr "Kila kitu hufanya kazi bila hiyo. Kupata toleo lililo nayo huchukua dakika chache, na inachosema huonekana chini ya Towe."

msgid "Carry on"
msgstr "Endelea"

msgid "Not mandatory -- YouTube then applies default values (Sony BVM-X300). To get them: in Resolve switch on HDR10+ under Color Management, run \"Analyze All Shots\" on the Color page and tick \"Embed HDR10 Metadata\" when rendering."
msgstr "Si lazima -- basi YouTube hutumia thamani chaguo-msingi (Sony BVM-X300). Kuzipata: katika Resolve washa HDR10+ chini ya Color Management, endesha \"Analyze All Shots\" kwenye ukurasa wa Color na uweke tiki kwenye \"Embed HDR10 Metadata\" unapotoa video."

msgid "Not ready yet:"
msgstr "Bado si tayari:"

msgid "Nothing was audible in the tracks."
msgstr "Hakuna kilichosikika katika treki."

msgid "One audio recording has no speaker name yet."
msgstr "Rekodi moja ya sauti bado haina jina la mzungumzaji."

msgid "One frame back."
msgstr "Fremu moja nyuma."

msgid "One second back."
msgstr "Sekunde moja nyuma."

msgid "Each shot in the colour of its camera. Hover for camera and duration, click to jump."
msgstr "Kila kipande kwa rangi ya kamera yake. Elea juu yake kuona kamera na muda, bofya kuruka."

msgid "Only one speaker"
msgstr "Mzungumzaji mmoja tu"

msgid "Open json project file"
msgstr "Fungua faili ya mradi ya json"

msgid "Open result folder"
msgstr "Fungua folda ya matokeo"

msgid "Open the settings, where the key is."
msgstr "Fungua mipangilio, mahali ufunguo ulipo."

msgid "Order does not matter. For a multi-part recording the first block is enough."
msgstr "Mpangilio haujalishi. Kwa rekodi ya sehemu nyingi, bloku ya kwanza inatosha."

msgid "Overwrite"
msgstr "Andika juu"

msgid "Overwrite files"
msgstr "Andika juu ya faili"

msgid "Pane %d loads %s (%s)"
msgstr "Kidirisha %d kinafungua %s (%s)"

msgid "Pane %d on %s"
msgstr "Kidirisha %d kwenye %s"

msgid "Play and pause -- the space bar works too."
msgstr "Cheza na sitisha -- kitufe cha nafasi pia kinafanya kazi."

msgid "Play and pause."
msgstr "Cheza na sitisha."

msgid "Playback not possible"
msgstr "Haiwezekani kucheza"

msgid "Playing %s -- the processed track from auphonic.com,\nbrought to broadcast level. The same audio as in the camera cut."
msgstr "Kucheza %s -- treki iliyochakatwa kutoka auphonic.com,\niliyoletwa kwenye kiwango cha utangazaji. Sauti ileile kama katika mkato wa kamera."

msgid "Playing %s -- the raw recording.\nIt is much quieter than the processed audio; once the tracks from auphonic.com\nare there, the preview takes those."
msgstr "Kucheza %s -- rekodi ghafi.\nIna sauti ndogo sana kuliko sauti iliyochakatwa; treki kutoka auphonic.com\nzikishafika, hakiki huzitumia hizo."

msgid "Possible reasons:\n  1. Resolve is not running -- the interface answers only while the program runs.\n  2. Preferences > System > General: external scripting is set to \"None\" instead of \"Local\".\n  3. Free edition: external scripting is reported to be reserved for the Studio edition since version 19.1. I found no official statement -- this check measures it instead of claiming it."
msgstr "Sababu zinazowezekana:\n  1. Resolve haiendeshwi -- kiolesura hujibu tu wakati programu inaendeshwa.\n  2. Preferences > System > General: skripti za nje zimewekwa kuwa \"None\" badala ya \"Local\".\n  3. Toleo la bure: inaripotiwa kwamba skripti za nje zimetengwa kwa toleo la Studio tangu toleo 19.1. Sikupata taarifa rasmi -- ukaguzi huu unapima jambo hilo badala ya kulidai."

msgid "Prepare pane %d for %s"
msgstr "Andaa kidirisha %d kwa %s"

msgid "Preset not readable: %s"
msgstr "Mpangilio awali hausomeki: %s"

msgid "Preview not possible: %s"
msgstr "Hakiki haiwezekani: %s"

msgid "Preview running ..."
msgstr "Hakiki inaendelea ..."

msgid "Prework -- read audio and compute envelopes:\n"
msgstr "Maandalizi -- kusoma sauti na kukokotoa mikunjo ya sauti:\n"

msgid "Primaries"
msgstr "Rangi za msingi"

msgid "Primaries number %d"
msgstr "Rangi za msingi namba %d"

msgid "Processing at auphonic.com (optional)"
msgstr "Uchakataji katika auphonic.com (hiari)"

msgid "Processing at auphonic.com with \"%s\""
msgstr "Uchakataji katika auphonic.com kwa \"%s\""

msgid "Production finished, but no ZIP with the individual tracks"
msgstr "Utayarishaji umekamilika, lakini hakuna ZIP yenye treki moja moja"

msgid "Production name"
msgstr "Jina la utayarishaji"

msgid "Chosen files"
msgstr "Faili zilizochaguliwa"

msgid "Remove the chosen file from the list"
msgstr "Ondoa faili iliyochaguliwa kwenye orodha"

msgid "Project %r could not be created."
msgstr "Mradi %r haukuweza kuundwa."

msgid "Project %r could not be created. Is the name already in another folder?"
msgstr "Mradi %r haukuweza kuundwa. Je, jina hilo tayari liko katika folda nyingine?"

msgid "Project %r could not be opened."
msgstr "Mradi %r haukuweza kufunguliwa."

msgid "Puts it back next to each video file."
msgstr "Huirudisha kando ya kila faili ya video."

msgid "ROLLBACK FAILED (%s)"
msgstr "KURUDISHA NYUMA KUMESHINDIKANA (%s)"

msgid "Reading audio track from %s"
msgstr "Kusoma treki ya sauti kutoka %s"

msgid "Resolutions"
msgstr "Resolusheni"

msgid "Resolve running ..."
msgstr "Resolve inaendeshwa ..."

msgid "Resolve scales to the Timeline resolution. Anything smaller is scaled up and gets softer."
msgstr "Resolve hubadilisha ukubwa kulingana na resolusheni ya Timeline. Chochote kilicho kidogo zaidi hukuzwa na kupoteza ukali."

msgid "Response was not JSON: %s"
msgstr "Jibu halikuwa JSON: %s"

msgid "Rows marked red show where the problem is; a tick on the tab means everything is there."
msgstr "Safu zilizowekwa alama nyekundu zinaonyesha tatizo liko wapi; alama ya tiki kwenye kichupo inamaanisha kila kitu kipo."

msgid "Save in Keychain"
msgstr "Hifadhi kwenye Keychain"

msgid "Save in Registry"
msgstr "Hifadhi kwenye Rejista"

msgid "Select audio and video files"
msgstr "Chagua faili za sauti na video"

msgid "Speakers, as the run measured them"
msgstr "Wazungumzaji, kama uendeshaji ulivyowapima"

msgid "Speakers, self-measured from the tracks"
msgstr "Wazungumzaji, waliopimwa na programu kutoka kwenye treki"

msgid "Started late or stopped early -- this voice is then missing from the mix in places."
msgstr "Ilianza kuchelewa au ilisimama mapema -- sauti hii ya mtu basi inakosekana katika mchanganyiko sehemu fulani."

msgid "Stopped. Choose another production name -- then a new production\n  is created -- or pick one of the other options."
msgstr "Imesimamishwa. Chagua jina lingine la utayarishaji -- basi utayarishaji mpya\n  unaundwa -- au chagua mojawapo ya chaguo nyingine."

msgid "Stopped. Nothing was created."
msgstr "Imesimamishwa. Hakuna kilichoundwa."

msgid "Stopped. Nothing was uploaded and nothing computed."
msgstr "Imesimamishwa. Hakuna kilichopakiwa wala kukokotolewa."

msgid "Used as it stands -- nothing is invented. Check in Resolve under Clip Attributes, tab Color Space: if it says \"Project\" there, the input colour space was not recognised and has to be set by hand."
msgstr "Inatumika kama ilivyo -- hakuna kinachobuniwa. Kagua katika Resolve chini ya Clip Attributes, kichupo cha Color Space: ikiwa inasema \"Project\" hapo, nafasi ya rangi ya ingizo haikutambuliwa na lazima iwekwe kwa mkono."

msgid "Takes the position from the picture."
msgstr "Huchukua nafasi kutoka kwenye picha."

msgid "Ten seconds back."
msgstr "Sekunde kumi nyuma."

msgid "The Resolve interface is not where I expect it:\n  %s\n  %s"
msgstr "Kiolesura cha Resolve hakipo mahali ninapotarajia:\n  %s\n  %s"

msgid "The Resolve interface is not where it should be."
msgstr "Kiolesura cha Resolve hakipo mahali kinapopaswa kuwa."

msgid "The Timeline gets one fixed rate -- the highest of them, or the next rate Resolve has above it. It converts the others; with 23.976 against 24 that is where its audio analysis tends to stall."
msgstr "Timeline hupata kasi moja isiyobadilika -- ya juu kabisa kati yake, au kasi inayofuata ambayo Resolve inayo juu yake. Resolve hubadilisha zile nyingine; kwa 23.976 dhidi ya 24 ndipo uchambuzi wake wa sauti huelekea kukwama."

msgid "The audio recording of every speaker, plus the cameras.\nThe order does not matter -- the program recognises what is what.\nFor a multi-part recording the first block is enough."
msgstr "Rekodi ya sauti ya kila mzungumzaji, pamoja na kamera.\nMpangilio haujalishi -- programu hutambua kipi ni kipi.\nKwa rekodi ya sehemu nyingi, bloku ya kwanza inatosha."

msgid "The cut has no picture there. When the Timeline is built the spot stays empty, the audio runs on."
msgstr "Mkato hauna picha hapo. Timeline inapojengwa sehemu hiyo hubaki tupu, sauti inaendelea."

msgid "The existing result is unusable: %s is missing there. With --auphonic-resume rerun it can be recomputed without uploading anything."
msgstr "Matokeo yaliyopo hayatumiki, kwa sababu humo kunakosekana: %s. Kwa --auphonic-resume rerun yanaweza kukokotolewa upya bila kupakia chochote."

msgid "The cut rules leave no shot standing in these %s. A shorter shortest shot, or less wide shot, gives one again."
msgstr "Kanuni za mkato haziachi kipande chochote katika muda huu wa %s. Kipande kifupi kabisa kikiwa kifupi zaidi, au picha pana ikiwa kidogo, kipande kitapatikana tena."

msgid "The programme is %s long here -- nothing can be laid out in that. In point and Out point are what set it."
msgstr "Kipindi hapa kina urefu wa %s -- hakuna kinachoweza kupangwa ndani yake. Alama ya kuingia na alama ya kutoka ndizo zinazouweka."

msgid "The time window lies outside the material: In point at %s, Out point at %s, and the material runs %s."
msgstr "Masafa ya muda yako nje ya nyenzo: alama ya kuingia kwenye %s, alama ya kutoka kwenye %s, na nyenzo ina muda wa %s."

msgid "The first preset track sets the settings for all our tracks. Otherwise they come back unprocessed. Create a track in the preset in the web interface."
msgstr "Treki ya kwanza ya mpangilio awali huweka mipangilio ya treki zetu zote. Vinginevyo zinarudi bila kuchakatwa. Unda treki katika mpangilio awali kwenye kiolesura cha wavuti."

msgid "That needs the handover file from a run, and there is none."
msgstr "Hilo linahitaji faili ya makabidhiano kutoka kwa uendeshaji, na hakuna."

msgid "The key can only be stored on Mac and Windows -- in the keychain or the registry. It does not go into a file."
msgstr "Ufunguo unaweza kuhifadhiwa kwenye Mac na Windows tu -- katika Keychain au Rejista. Hauwekwi kwenye faili."

msgid "%s -- being checked"
msgstr "%s -- ukaguzi unaendelea"

msgid "The key was not saved: %s"
msgstr "Ufunguo haukuhifadhiwa: %s"

msgid "The keychain is locked. Unlock it and try again."
msgstr "Keychain imefungwa. Ifungue kisha ujaribu tena."

msgid "This run is a test run and the store still carries its real name, so nothing was written. Point KEY_SERVICE, KEY_ACCOUNT or REG_PATH somewhere else first."
msgstr "Uendeshaji huu ni wa majaribio na hifadhi bado ina jina lake halisi, kwa hivyo hakuna kilichoandikwa. Elekeza kwanza KEY_SERVICE, KEY_ACCOUNT au REG_PATH mahali pengine."

msgid "The keychain is locked. Unlock it and this button wakes up."
msgstr "Keychain imefungwa. Ifungue na kitufe hiki kitaamka."

msgid "The keychain did not take the key. Keychain Access can say why."
msgstr "Keychain haikupokea ufunguo. Keychain Access inaweza kueleza sababu."

msgid "The registry did not take the key."
msgstr "Rejista haikupokea ufunguo."

msgid "Open Keychain Access"
msgstr "Fungua Keychain Access"

msgid "Opens the app that unlocks the keychain."
msgstr "Hufungua programu inayofungua Keychain."

msgid "  Keychain Access could not be opened: %s"
msgstr "  Keychain Access haikuweza kufunguliwa: %s"

msgid "The stored key is not accepted: %s"
msgstr "Ufunguo uliohifadhiwa haukubaliwi: %s"

msgid "The key from AUPHONIC_TOKEN is not accepted: %s"
msgstr "Ufunguo kutoka AUPHONIC_TOKEN haukubaliwi: %s"

msgid "What auphonic.com replied"
msgstr "Jibu la auphonic.com"

msgid "There is no key."
msgstr "Hakuna ufunguo."

msgid "The key has a space or a line break at one end."
msgstr "Ufunguo una nafasi au mstari mpya kwenye mojawapo ya ncha zake."

msgid "The key is broken in the middle by a space or a line break."
msgstr "Ufunguo umekatwa katikati na nafasi au mstari mpya."

msgid "The key has a character in it that cannot be typed."
msgstr "Ufunguo una herufi ambayo haiwezi kuandikwa kwa kibodi."

msgid "The key is then in the %s, never in a file."
msgstr "Ufunguo basi utakuwa katika %s, kamwe si kwenye faili."

msgid "The production has no name yet."
msgstr "Utayarishaji bado hauna jina."

msgid "The recording assigned to this camera instead of the camera audio."
msgstr "Rekodi iliyogawiwa kamera hii badala ya sauti ya kamera."

msgid "The run is still going."
msgstr "Uendeshaji bado unaendelea."

msgid "No speakers are known yet -- they are worked out of the tracks as soon as this tab is opened. Where everybody is on one recording, \"several speakers\" in the Speaker name field is the way."
msgstr "Bado hakuna wazungumzaji wanaojulikana -- wanatambuliwa kutoka kwenye treki mara kichupo hiki kinapofunguliwa. Ambapo kila mtu yuko kwenye rekodi moja, \"wazungumzaji kadhaa\" katika sehemu ya Jina la mzungumzaji ndiyo njia."

msgid "The three numbers are primaries, curve and matrix. Different tags need different input colour spaces in Resolve -- otherwise one camera looks unlike the other."
msgstr "Namba hizo tatu ni rangi za msingi, mkunjo na matriki. Lebo tofauti zinahitaji nafasi tofauti za rangi ya ingizo katika Resolve -- vinginevyo kamera moja itaonekana tofauti na nyingine."

msgid "There are no separate audio recordings. Then the audio of the %s cameras is used -- each becomes a track, and Auphonic removes the bleed."
msgstr "Hakuna rekodi tofauti za sauti. Basi sauti za kamera zote %s zinatumika -- kila moja inakuwa treki, na Auphonic huondoa uvujaji wa sauti."

msgid "There is no result yet."
msgstr "Bado hakuna matokeo."

msgid "These files are neither audio nor video and stay out:\n\n  %s"
msgstr "Faili hizi si za sauti wala video na zinabaki nje:\n\n  %s"

msgid "These files do not exist:\n  "
msgstr "Faili hizi hazipo:\n  "

msgid "These files exist already and will be written again:\n\n  %s\n\nIs that intended?"
msgstr "Faili hizi tayari zipo na zitaandikwa upya:\n\n  %s\n\nJe, hivyo ndivyo unavyokusudia?"

msgid "These files no longer exist:\n  "
msgstr "Faili hizi hazipo tena:\n  "

msgid "These names occur more than once:\n\n  %s\n\nThe recordings are merged into one track and laid end to end by their timecode. That is right if recording was stopped in between."
msgstr "Majina haya yanajitokeza zaidi ya mara moja:\n\n  %s\n\nRekodi zinaunganishwa kuwa treki moja na kupangwa mfululizo kwa timecode zake. Hilo ni sahihi ikiwa kurekodi kulisimamishwa katikati."

msgid "These tracks got no file: %s"
msgstr "Treki hizi hazikupata faili: %s"

msgid "This Resolve project already exists"
msgstr "Mradi huu wa Resolve tayari upo"

msgid "This comes from the recording, not afterwards: the microphones sit too close together or too far from the mouth."
msgstr "Hili linatokana na kurekodi, si baadaye: maikrofoni ziko karibu mno kati yao au mbali mno na mdomo."

msgid "This file cannot be played here, and ffplay is missing as a fallback."
msgstr "Faili hii haiwezi kuchezwa hapa, na ffplay haipo kama mbadala."

msgid "This is not a project file, and there is none in the same folder.\n\nThe search is for %s*.json -- the script writes it into the output folder at start."
msgstr "Hii si faili ya mradi, na hakuna iliyo katika folda hiyo hiyo.\n\nUtafutaji ni wa %s*.json -- skripti huiandika kwenye folda ya towe inapoanza."

msgid "This is what happens next"
msgstr "Hiki ndicho kitakachofuata"

msgid "This name is on somebody else already. A name is a person, and the cut puts a person on one camera -- please give this voice its own."
msgstr "Jina hili tayari ni la mtu mwingine. Jina ni mtu, na mkato humweka mtu kwenye kamera moja -- tafadhali ipe sauti hii jina lake."

msgid "This name occurs more than once. The recordings would become one track -- for Multitrack auphonic.com needs at least two different ones."
msgstr "Jina hili linajitokeza zaidi ya mara moja. Rekodi zingekuwa treki moja -- kwa Multitrack auphonic.com inahitaji angalau mbili tofauti."

msgid "This production already exists"
msgstr "Utayarishaji huu tayari upo"

msgid "This production has no result yet."
msgstr "Utayarishaji huu bado hauna matokeo."

msgid "Time limit of %s reached, production still running: %s/engine/status/%s"
msgstr "Kikomo cha muda cha %s kimefikiwa, utayarishaji bado unaendelea: %s/engine/status/%s"

msgid "Timecode %s, the other files are at %s -- this clock was not set."
msgstr "Timecode %s, faili nyingine ziko kwenye %s -- saa hii haikuwekwa."

msgid "Timeline %r could not be created."
msgstr "Timeline %r haikuweza kuundwa."

msgid "Title at auphonic.com and start of the new file names."
msgstr "Kichwa katika auphonic.com na mwanzo wa majina mapya ya faili."

msgid "To the In point."
msgstr "Hadi alama ya kuingia."

msgid "To the start."
msgstr "Hadi mwanzo."

msgid "Too many projects with this name."
msgstr "Miradi mingi mno yenye jina hili."

msgid "Track"
msgstr "Treki"

msgid "Tracks were added while changing (now %s). That makes the mix\n  wrong. Please delete the tracks without a file at auphonic.com."
msgstr "Treki ziliongezwa wakati wa kubadilisha (sasa %s). Hilo linafanya mchanganyiko\n  kuwa na makosa. Tafadhali futa treki zisizo na faili katika auphonic.com."

msgid "Two cameras would produce the same file. The second would overwrite the first."
msgstr "Kamera mbili zingetoa faili ileile. Ya pili ingeandika juu ya ya kwanza."

msgid "Two cameras would produce the same file: %s"
msgstr "Kamera mbili zingetoa faili ileile: %s"

msgid "Two cameras would produce the same new file. Please give different names."
msgstr "Kamera mbili zingetoa faili mpya ileile. Tafadhali toa majina tofauti."

msgid "Uneven frame timing cannot be evened out through the audio. If the sample points spread during alignment as well, convert to a fixed frame rate."
msgstr "Muda usio sawa wa fremu hauwezi kusawazishwa kupitia sauti. Ikiwa pointi za sampuli pia zinatawanyika wakati wa upangaji sawa, badilisha kuwa kasi ya fremu isiyobadilika."

msgid "Video"
msgstr "Video"

msgid "Video 1"
msgstr "Video 1"

msgid "Video 2"
msgstr "Video 2"

msgid "Video Podcast Magic %s -- raw material becomes an edited podcast"
msgstr "Video Podcast Magic %s -- nyenzo ghafi zinakuwa podikasti iliyohaririwa"

msgid "Volume. 100 is as loud as it goes -- Qt takes nothing above that."
msgstr "Kiasi cha sauti. 100 ndicho kiwango cha juu kabisa -- Qt haikubali chochote zaidi ya hapo."

msgid "%s (%s) -- talking at once counts twice"
msgstr "%s (%s) -- kuzungumza kwa wakati mmoja huhesabiwa mara mbili"

msgid "Wide shot at most"
msgstr "Picha pana isizidi"

msgid "Wide shot at the latest"
msgstr "Picha pana si baadaye kuliko"

msgid "Wide shot for greeting at the start and farewell at the end"
msgstr "Picha pana kwa salamu mwanzoni na kuaga mwishoni"

msgid "Without it every player has to guess, and all guess SDR. In Resolve under Deliver > Advanced Settings set the Color space tag and the Gamma tag instead of leaving them at \"Same as Project\"."
msgstr "Bila hiyo kila kicheza lazima kikisie, na vyote vinakisia SDR. Katika Resolve chini ya Deliver > Advanced Settings weka Color space tag na Gamma tag badala ya kuziacha kwenye \"Same as Project\"."

msgid "Without processing at auphonic.com"
msgstr "Bila uchakataji katika auphonic.com"

msgid "There is no camera cut yet: it needs two people, each with a name and a camera.\nSeparate recordings give that with the Multitrack tick, and so does \"several speakers\" in the Speaker name field of one recording --\nthe voices found there get their camera in the table under the recordings.\nA Resolve project is created anyway -- all cameras at their measured places, ready for Multicam."
msgstr "Bado hakuna mkato wa kamera: unahitaji watu wawili, kila mmoja na jina na kamera.\nRekodi tofauti hutoa hilo kwa alama ya tiki ya Multitrack, vivyo hivyo \"wazungumzaji kadhaa\" katika sehemu ya Jina la mzungumzaji ya rekodi moja --\nsauti za watu zinazopatikana hapo hupata kamera zao katika jedwali chini ya rekodi.\nMradi wa Resolve unaundwa hata hivyo -- kamera zote kwenye nafasi zao zilizopimwa, tayari kwa Multicam."

msgid "Without timecode the position of the files is measured."
msgstr "Bila timecode, nafasi ya faili hupimwa."

msgid "Works out who speaks when from the tracks themselves -- one microphone per person, level against its own noise floor. Where everybody is on one recording, \"several speakers\" in the Speaker name field is the way."
msgstr "Hutambua nani anazungumza lini kutoka kwenye treki zenyewe -- maikrofoni moja kwa kila mtu, kiwango dhidi ya kelele yake ya msingi. Ambapo kila mtu yuko kwenye rekodi moja, \"wazungumzaji kadhaa\" katika sehemu ya Jina la mzungumzaji ndiyo njia."

msgid "YouTube -- turns down only, never up"
msgstr "YouTube -- hupunguza tu, haiongezi"

msgid "a box no longer fits into its parent"
msgstr "kisanduku hakiingii tena ndani ya kile kinachokibeba"

msgid "after the device change"
msgstr "baada ya kubadilisha kifaa"

msgid "auphonic.com does not accept the key: %s"
msgstr "auphonic.com haikubali ufunguo: %s"

msgid "average"
msgstr "wastani"

msgid "belongs to"
msgstr "ni ya"

msgid "bleed too indistinct: %s of %s seconds usable, sharpest %s of %s needed"
msgstr "uvujaji wa sauti haueleweki vya kutosha: sekunde %s kati ya %s zinatumika, ukali wa juu kabisa %s kati ya %s unaohitajika"

msgid "Midnight"
msgstr "Saa sita usiku"

msgid "%s carries a timecode from the other side of midnight -- counted as one night, not as a day apart."
msgstr "Timecode kutoka upande mwingine wa saa sita usiku: %s -- inahesabiwa kama usiku mmoja, si tofauti ya siku moja."

msgid "A timecode counts from midnight and starts over there. The files are put on one axis before anything is subtracted, otherwise the recording after midnight looks almost a day away from the one before. If these really were recorded on different days, the alignment is wrong and the measured offset is the one to trust."
msgstr "Timecode huhesabu kuanzia saa sita usiku na huanza upya hapo. Faili huwekwa kwenye mhimili mmoja kabla ya kutoa chochote, vinginevyo rekodi ya baada ya saa sita usiku ingeonekana kuwa karibu siku nzima mbali na ile ya kabla. Ikiwa kweli hizi zilirekodiwa siku tofauti, upangaji sawa si sahihi na msogeo uliopimwa ndio wa kuaminiwa."

msgid "Channel %d is against the stop: %s times three samples or more in a row, the longest %s (%s ms), the first at %s."
msgstr "Chaneli %d imegonga kikomo: mara %s sampuli tatu au zaidi mfululizo, ndefu zaidi %s (%s ms), ya kwanza kwenye %s."

msgid "Counted here, sample by sample, at the rate the file was recorded at: a run of three or more samples on the highest value an integer format can hold. One or two are rounding and are not reported. What is cut off there is gone and no processing brings it back -- but the recording is still the recording, and this holds nothing up. Only integer formats are counted. 32 bit float has no stop at full scale, so there is nothing there to count."
msgstr "Huhesabiwa hapa, sampuli kwa sampuli, kwa kasi ambayo faili ilirekodiwa: mfululizo wa sampuli tatu au zaidi kwenye thamani ya juu kabisa ambayo muundo wa namba kamili unaweza kubeba. Moja au mbili ni ukadiriaji na haziripotiwi. Kilichokatwa hapo kimepotea na hakuna uchakataji unaoweza kukirudisha -- lakini rekodi bado ni rekodi, na hili halizuii chochote. Miundo ya namba kamili pekee ndiyo huhesabiwa. 32 bit float haina kikomo kwenye kipimo kamili, kwa hivyo hakuna cha kuhesabu hapo."

msgid "boxes no longer readable"
msgstr "visanduku havisomeki tena"

msgid "bring up to date -- both Timelines are deleted and\n       rebuilt, the media pool stays as it is"
msgstr "sasisha -- Timeline zote mbili zinafutwa na\n       kujengwa upya, Media Pool inabaki kama ilivyo"

msgid "cannot be read back (%s)"
msgstr "haiwezi kusomwa tena (%s)"

msgid "checking ..."
msgstr "inakagua ..."

msgid "complete"
msgstr "kamili"

msgid "create a new project alongside (name with suffix)"
msgstr "unda mradi mpya kando yake (jina lenye kiambishi)"

msgid "curl ended with %d"
msgstr "curl ilimalizika kwa %d"

msgid "did not arrive: %s"
msgstr "havikufika: %s"

msgid "does not belong: %s"
msgstr "haihusiki: %s"

msgid "does not exist: %s"
msgstr "haipo: %s"

msgid "does the material fit together?"
msgstr "je, nyenzo zinaendana?"

msgid "does the preset fit the run?"
msgstr "je, mpangilio awali unafaa uendeshaji?"

msgid "downloaded file is only %s bytes"
msgstr "faili iliyopakuliwa ina baiti %s tu"

msgid "gap of %s per timecode, too far apart for one recording"
msgstr "pengo la %s kwa mujibu wa timecode, mbali mno kwa rekodi moja"

msgid "gets audio from"
msgstr "hupata sauti kutoka"

msgid "hear assigned audio"
msgstr "sikia sauti iliyogawiwa"

msgid "keep our names and upload everything again -- this costs\n       credit"
msgstr "baki na majina yetu na upakie kila kitu tena -- hii hutumia\n       salio"

msgid "leave it and put the new Timelines alongside --\n       the existing ones stay"
msgstr "iache na uweke Timeline mpya kando yake --\n       zilizopo zinabaki"

msgid "missing -- the container carries no colour tagging"
msgstr "haipo -- kontena haina lebo za rangi"

msgid "missing: %s"
msgstr "vinakosekana: %s"

msgid "moov has not grown"
msgstr "moov haijakua"

msgid "moov is no longer in its place"
msgstr "moov haiko tena mahali pake"

msgid "moov no longer ends at the end of the file"
