msgstr "%r inahesabu kutoka mwisho -- hilo linawezekana kwa alama ya kutoka pekee."

msgid "Check"
msgstr "Ukaguzi"

msgid "the check itself stopped: %s"
msgstr "ukaguzi wenyewe ulisimama: %s"

msgid "In point or Out point cannot be read here."
msgstr "Alama ya kuingia au alama ya kutoka haiwezi kusomwa hapa."

msgid "Out point lies less than 5 seconds after In point."
msgstr "Alama ya kutoka iko chini ya sekunde 5 baada ya alama ya kuingia."

msgid "About %s missing. Free up space or choose another folder with --out. The temporary files during the run go somewhere else again, into the system temp folder."
msgstr "Kunakosekana takriban %s. Toa nafasi au chagua folda nyingine kwa --out. Faili za muda wakati wa uendeshaji huenda mahali pengine tena, kwenye folda ya muda ya mfumo."

msgid "The estimate is rough, so this is not room enough. Free up space or choose another folder with --out."
msgstr "Makadirio ni ya jumla, kwa hiyo nafasi hii haitoshi. Toa nafasi au chagua folda nyingine kwa --out."

msgid "\nSPEAKERS -- MEASURED HERE"
msgstr "\nWAZUNGUMZAJI -- WAMEPIMWA HAPA"

msgid "\nSPEAKERS -- SEPARATED BY VOICE"
msgstr "\nWAZUNGUMZAJI -- WAMETENGANISHWA KWA SAUTI"

msgid "\nSPEAKERS\n  Nobody was heard -- no camera cut from this."
msgstr "\nWAZUNGUMZAJI\n  Hakuna aliyesikika -- hakuna mkato wa kamera kutokana na hili."

msgid "\nCAMERA CUT"
msgstr "\nMKATO WA KAMERA"

msgid "\nCUT WITH THE WIDE SHOT"
msgstr "\nMKATO PAMOJA NA PICHA PANA"

msgid "\nFIRST CUT BY SPEAKER"
msgstr "\nMKATO WA KWANZA KWA MZUNGUMZAJI"

msgid "  More than two channels go to auphonic.com as one: the fold is only switched off for stereo.\n  Where the channels are meant to stay apart, cut the file into tracks first."
msgstr "  Chaneli zaidi ya mbili huenda auphonic.com kama moja: kuziunganisha kuwa moja huzimwa kwa stereo pekee.\n  Pale chaneli zinapopaswa kubaki tofauti, kata faili kuwa treki kwanza."

msgid "First cut by speaker"
msgstr "Mkato wa kwanza kwa mzungumzaji"

msgid "\nTRANSCRIPT"
msgstr "\nNAKALA"

msgid "  %s words: %s %% to one voice, %s %% to two, %s %% in a gap"
msgstr "  Maneno %s: %s %% kwa sauti moja, %s %% kwa mbili, %s %% kwenye pengo"

msgid "  %s words, without names -- nobody was separated"
msgstr "  Maneno %s, bila majina -- hakuna aliyetenganishwa"

msgid "  %s could not be written: %s"
msgstr "  Haikuwezekana kuandika %s: %s"

msgid "\nSEPARATING THE SPEAKERS"
msgstr "\nKUTENGANISHA WAZUNGUMZAJI"

msgid "  Separated once already: read back, not measured again."
msgstr "  Imeshatenganishwa mara moja: inasomwa tena, haipimwi upya."

msgid "  About %s of computing for %s of audio."
msgstr "  Takriban muda wa %s wa kukokotoa kwa sauti ya %s."

msgid "  (measuring only: nothing separated)"
msgstr "  (kupima pekee: hakuna kilichotenganishwa)"

msgid "  The tracks were not measured, so %s is in the mix and not in the cut: %s"
msgstr "  Treki hazikupimwa, kwa hiyo %s -- kwenye mchanganyiko, si kwenye mkato: %s"

msgid "%s not measured yet -- in the cut, not yet in this preview."
msgstr "Bado bila kipimo: %s -- kwenye mkato ndiyo, kwenye hakiki hii bado."

msgid "  From the tracks themselves, one voice per track: %s."
msgstr "  Kutoka kwenye treki zenyewe, sauti moja kwa kila treki: %s."

msgid "  In %s, on this machine."
msgstr "  Ndani ya %s, kwenye kompyuta hii."

msgid "  The microphones hear each other too well to say who is speaking, so the separation listens to all %s of them at once, on this machine."
msgstr "  Maikrofoni zinasikiana vizuri mno kuweza kusema nani anazungumza, kwa hiyo utenganishaji unazisikiliza zote %s kwa pamoja, kwenye kompyuta hii."

msgid "  What the window took apart is dropped: it listened to one recording, and the microphones hear each other so well that none of them stands out -- %s dB against the %s dB one of them alone needs to say who is speaking."
msgstr "  Kile ambacho dirisha lilitenganisha kinatupwa: lilisikiliza rekodi moja, na maikrofoni zinasikiana vizuri sana kiasi kwamba hakuna inayojitokeza -- %s dB dhidi ya %s dB ambazo maikrofoni moja pekee inahitaji ili kusema nani anazungumza."

msgid "Mixing the tracks for the separation"
msgstr "Kuchanganya treki kwa ajili ya utenganishaji"

msgid "  Which voice belongs to which microphone could not be told, so the tracks are measured instead."
msgstr "  Haikuwezekana kusema sauti ipi ni ya maikrofoni ipi, kwa hiyo treki zinapimwa badala yake."

msgid "  %-20s is %-20s %s dB ahead of the next microphone, the recording level taken out"
msgstr "  %-20s ni %-20s %s dB mbele ya maikrofoni inayofuata, kiwango cha kurekodi kimeondolewa"

msgid "  The speaker separation is not used: %s."
msgstr "  Utenganishaji wa wazungumzaji hautumiwi: %s."

msgid "  %s cannot be read: %s"
msgstr "  Haiwezekani kusoma %s: %s"

msgid "%s is not part of this run"
msgstr "%s si sehemu ya uendeshaji huu"

msgid "%s has no place on the axis"
msgstr "Hakuna nafasi kwa %s kwenye mhimili wa muda"

msgid "no recording named"
msgstr "hakuna rekodi iliyotajwa"

msgid "nothing of it falls inside the window"
msgstr "hakuna sehemu yake inayoangukia ndani ya masafa ya muda"

msgid "the interface"
msgstr "kiolesura"

msgid "the separation in this run"
msgstr "utenganishaji katika uendeshaji huu"

msgid "Speakers, separated by voice"
msgstr "Wazungumzaji, waliotenganishwa kwa sauti"

msgid "That produced no cut -- press Start above again."
msgstr "Hilo halikutoa mkato -- bonyeza Anza hapo juu tena."

msgid "\nWITHOUT AUPHONIC.COM"
msgstr "\nBILA AUPHONIC.COM"

msgid "  Bleed measured, %s in %s only %s dB quieter -- taken out of the speech detection"
msgstr "  Uvujaji wa sauti umepimwa, %s ndani ya %s iko chini kwa %s dB tu -- umeondolewa kwenye utambuzi wa usemi"

msgid "  Bleed not separable: %s"
msgstr "  Uvujaji wa sauti hauwezi kutenganishwa: %s"

msgid "  No moment found where exactly one person speaks -- the bleed stays in the speech detection."
msgstr "  Hakuna wakati uliopatikana ambapo mtu mmoja tu anazungumza -- uvujaji wa sauti unabaki kwenye utambuzi wa usemi."

msgid "  Nothing was audible in the tracks -- no camera cut from this."
msgstr "  Hakuna kilichosikika kwenye treki -- hakuna mkato wa kamera kutokana na hili."

msgid "  Not in the cut: %s -- a separation speaks for the recording, or it was not measured."
msgstr "  Si kwenye mkato: %s -- utenganishaji unawakilisha rekodi, au haikupimwa."

msgid "  The tracks are used as recorded: aligned, mixed and brought to the\n  target loudness. No de-bleed, no leveler, no noise removal -- for\n  those the run needs auphonic.com."
msgstr "  Treki zinatumika kama zilivyorekodiwa: zimepangwa sawa, zimechanganywa na kufikishwa\n  kwenye lengo la ukubwa wa sauti. Bila De-Bleed, bila Leveler, bila kuondoa kelele --\n  kwa hayo uendeshaji unahitaji auphonic.com."

msgid "  --without-auphonic and --auphonic-done were both given. The finished tracks win: there is nothing left to send anywhere."
msgstr "  --without-auphonic na --auphonic-done zimetolewa zote mbili. Treki zilizokamilika zinashinda: hakuna kilichobaki cha kutuma popote."

msgid "MULTITRACK NOT POSSIBLE\n  Without an API key there is nothing to send to auphonic.com.\n  With --without-auphonic it runs locally instead: aligned,\n  mixed and cut, but without de-bleed and leveler."
msgstr "MULTITRACK HAIWEZEKANI\n  Bila ufunguo wa API hakuna cha kutuma kwa auphonic.com.\n  Kwa --without-auphonic inaendeshwa kwenye kompyuta hii badala yake: imepangwa sawa,\n  imechanganywa na kukatwa, lakini bila De-Bleed na Leveler."

msgid "  Caution: only %s of %s pairs measurable. For the rest no moment was found where exactly one person speaks, so their bleed stays in -- the speaker detection is unreliable here."
msgstr "  Tahadhari: jozi %s tu kati ya %s zinapimika. Kwa zilizobaki hakuna wakati uliopatikana ambapo mtu mmoja tu anazungumza, kwa hiyo uvujaji wa sauti wa jozi hizo unabaki -- utambuzi wa wazungumzaji hauaminiki hapa."

msgid "the microphones hear each other almost as loudly as their own speaker"
msgstr "maikrofoni zinasikiana karibu kwa nguvu sawa na mzungumzaji wao mwenyewe"

msgid "the tracks are too much alike to separate"
msgstr "treki zinafanana mno kuweza kutenganishwa"

msgid "Reading the plan"
msgstr "Kusoma mpango"

msgid "Audio out of the cameras"
msgstr "Sauti kutoka kwa kamera"

msgid "Common time axis"
msgstr "Mhimili wa muda wa pamoja"

msgid "Processing at auphonic.com"
msgstr "Uchakataji kwenye auphonic.com"

msgid "Loudness"
msgstr "Ukubwa wa sauti"

msgid "Loudness and levels"
msgstr "Ukubwa wa sauti na viwango"

msgid "Loudness of the finished episode"
msgstr "Ukubwa wa sauti wa kipindi kilichokamilika"

msgid "How loud the finished episode is made. The same gain goes on every\ntrack, so the balance between the speakers is kept.\n\"Take from source files\" adjusts nothing at all: auphonic.com goes\non doing what its preset says, and without auphonic.com the sound\nstays as it is in the source files."
msgstr "Jinsi sauti ya kipindi kilichokamilika inavyofanywa kuwa kubwa. Ukuzaji uleule unawekwa kwenye kila\ntreki, kwa hiyo uwiano kati ya wazungumzaji unadumishwa.\n\"Chukua kutoka faili chanzo\" haibadilishi chochote: auphonic.com inaendelea\nkufanya kile mpangilio wake awali unachosema, na bila auphonic.com sauti\ninabaki kama ilivyo kwenye faili chanzo."

msgid "    Loudness was not adjusted -- the target below is only what the meter\n    measures against."
msgstr "    Ukubwa wa sauti haukurekebishwa -- lengo lililo hapa chini ni kile tu\n    ambacho kipimo kinapima dhidi yake."

msgid "Who speaks when"
msgstr "Nani anazungumza lini"

msgid "Writing the camera files"
msgstr "Kuandika faili za kamera"

msgid "Handover and result"
msgstr "Makabidhiano na matokeo"

msgid "Show twice as much (minus key, or the wheel over the band)"
msgstr "Onyesha mara mbili zaidi (kitufe cha minus, au gurudumu juu ya ukanda)"

msgid "Show half as much, around the current position (plus key, or the wheel over the band)"
msgstr "Onyesha nusu yake, kuzunguka mahali pa sasa (kitufe cha plus, au gurudumu juu ya ukanda)"

msgid "The whole length again (0 key)"
msgstr "Urefu wote tena (kitufe 0)"

msgid "  Also fetched: %s"
msgstr "  Pia imeletwa: %s"

msgid "Auphonic will not take the settings: %s"
msgstr "Auphonic haikubali mipangilio: %s"

msgid "      %s channels"
msgstr "      chaneli %s"

msgid "measurement running ..."
msgstr "kipimo kinaendelea ..."

msgid "      Channel %d"
msgstr "      Chaneli %d"

msgid "Looking at the channels"
msgstr "Kuchunguza chaneli"

msgid "channels not readable: %s"
msgstr "chaneli hazisomeki: %s"

msgid "unused input -- ignored"
msgstr "ingizo lisilotumika -- limepuuzwa"

msgid "uncertain -- %s"
msgstr "haina uhakika -- %s"

msgid "set by hand -- overrides the measurement"
msgstr "imewekwa kwa mkono -- inabatilisha kipimo"

msgid "both channels identical -- mono laid on both sides"
msgstr "chaneli zote mbili zinafanana -- mono imewekwa pande zote mbili"

msgid "probably two microphones -- about %s m apart%s"
msgstr "huenda ni maikrofoni mbili -- umbali wa takriban %s m kati yao%s"

msgid ", agreed at %s of %s places"
msgstr ", zinakubaliana katika sehemu %s kati ya %s"

msgid "probably one stereo track -- both microphones in the same place"
msgstr "huenda ni treki moja ya stereo -- maikrofoni zote mbili mahali pamoja"

msgid "not recognisable -- only %s of %s places where both channels carry sound, %s needed"
msgstr "haitambuliki -- sehemu %s tu kati ya %s ambapo chaneli zote mbili zina sauti, zinahitajika %s"

msgid "not recognisable -- these two agree no better than each does with the channel beside it"
msgstr "haitambuliki -- hizi mbili hazilingani vizuri zaidi kuliko kila moja inavyolingana na chaneli iliyo kando yake"

msgid "not set"
msgstr "haijawekwa"

msgid "The language spoken in the recording. It becomes the tag of the\nwritten audio track, and the recognition here is told to expect it.\nPreset from the system language. \"%s\" leaves the track untagged\nand lets the recognition work the language out itself."
msgstr "Lugha inayozungumzwa kwenye rekodi. Inakuwa lebo ya\ntreki ya sauti inayoandikwa, na utambuzi hapa unaambiwa uitarajie.\nImewekwa awali kutoka lugha ya mfumo. \"%s\" huacha treki bila lebo\nna huuachia utambuzi kubaini lugha wenyewe."

