msgid "Cutting out track %d of %d"
msgstr "Kukata treki %d kati ya %d"

msgid "cutting failed: %s"
msgstr "ukataji umeshindwa: %s"

msgid "  One camera for everybody: cut into %s shots at the change of speaker, so Resolve can group them."
msgstr "  Kamera moja kwa wote: imekatwa kuwa vipande %s kwenye mabadiliko ya mzungumzaji, ili Resolve iweze kuviweka katika vikundi."

msgid "Shorter shots fall into the following one."
msgstr "Vipande vifupi zaidi vinaingia kwenye kinachofuata."

msgid "Speaks at least"
msgstr "Anazungumza angalau"

msgid "below this the camera does not follow"
msgstr "chini ya hapa kamera haifuati"

msgid "A short \"yes\" does not move the picture. Without this a block of half a second draws the camera over, and the minimum edit duration then holds it there for seconds."
msgstr "\"Ndiyo\" fupi haisogezi picha. Bila hili, bloku ya nusu sekunde huvuta kamera upande wake, na kisha muda wa chini wa kipande huishikilia hapo kwa sekunde kadhaa."

msgid "Answer on screen earlier"
msgstr "Jibu kwenye skrini mapema"

msgid "before the question ends"
msgstr "kabla swali halijaisha"

msgid "Zero is where the asker stops, not where the answer starts: the pause between them belongs to the question. Applies only where \"After a question\" asks for it, and the Edit Change Delay is not added again."
msgstr "Sifuri ni pale muulizaji anaposimama, si pale jibu linapoanza: kituo kati yao ni sehemu ya swali. Inatumika tu pale \"Baada ya swali\" inapoitaka, na Edit Change Delay haiongezwi tena."

msgid "Wide shot at least"
msgstr "Picha pana angalau"

msgid "so long the inserted wide shot stands at least"
msgstr "picha pana iliyoingizwa hudumu angalau muda huu"

msgid "It then runs to the end of the sentence. Below five seconds the look reads as a twitch."
msgstr "Kisha inaendelea hadi mwisho wa sentensi. Chini ya sekunde tano mtazamo huo unaonekana kama mshtuko."

msgid "and at most this long"
msgstr "na isizidi muda huu"

msgid "Where the end of the sentence lies beyond it, the last clause break before it ends the shot -- it is not cut off mid-sentence."
msgstr "Pale mwisho wa sentensi unapozidi hapo, mpaka wa mwisho wa kishazi kabla yake humaliza picha pana -- haikatwi katikati ya sentensi."

msgid "Long monologue"
msgstr "Monolojia ndefu"

msgid "one person holds the floor past \"Wide shot after\""
msgstr "mtu mmoja anaendelea kuzungumza kupita \"Picha pana baada ya\""

msgid "\"Alternating\" remembers what the last break of this monologue showed. The listener only gets the picture when someone on that camera was heard in the last 20 seconds; otherwise the wide shot."
msgstr "\"Kwa zamu\" hukumbuka kile ambacho mkatizo wa mwisho wa monolojia hii ulionyesha. Msikilizaji hupata picha tu ikiwa mtu kwenye kamera hiyo alisikika katika sekunde 20 zilizopita; vinginevyo picha pana."

msgid "Several speak at once"
msgstr "Kadhaa wanazungumza pamoja"

msgid "and no camera shows exactly them"
msgstr "na hakuna kamera inayowaonyesha wao hasa"

msgid "Cutting into a jumble looks frantic."
msgstr "Kukata katikati ya vurugu kunaonekana kama pupa."

msgid "Nobody speaks"
msgstr "Hakuna anayezungumza"

msgid "no voice is heard at all here"
msgstr "hakuna sauti ya mtu hapa kabisa"

msgid "A breath in the middle of a sentence and the end of a thought are both silence, and the program cannot tell them apart. Only the length can: \"Short gap up to\" says how long a silence may be and still count as a breath."
msgstr "Pumzi katikati ya sentensi na mwisho wa wazo vyote ni kimya, na programu haiwezi kuvitofautisha. Urefu pekee ndio unaweza: \"Pengo fupi hadi\" husema kimya kinaweza kudumu kwa muda gani na bado kuhesabiwa kama pumzi."

msgid "Short gap up to"
msgstr "Pengo fupi hadi"

msgid "so long a silence leaves the picture alone"
msgstr "kimya cha muda huu hakiigusi picha"

msgid "Only where \"Nobody speaks\" is set to hold a short gap. A gap up to this long changes nothing, a longer one goes to the wide shot. Above two seconds the picture begins to stand on someone silent for over five seconds."
msgstr "Tu pale \"Hakuna anayezungumza\" imewekwa kushikilia pengo fupi. Pengo hadi urefu huu halibadilishi chochote, refu zaidi linaenda kwenye picha pana. Zaidi ya sekunde mbili picha huanza kukaa kwa mtu aliyenyamaza kwa zaidi ya sekunde tano."

msgid "Recognition uncertain"
msgstr "Utambuzi hauna uhakika"

msgid "the speaker recognition frays or leaves a heap behind"
msgstr "utambuzi wa wazungumzaji unasambaratika au unaacha rundo"

msgid "Guessing puts the wrong person on screen for seconds; the wide shot is right in every case. Somebody is speaking here -- where nobody is, \"Nobody speaks\" decides."
msgstr "Kubahatisha huweka mtu asiye sahihi kwenye skrini kwa sekunde kadhaa; picha pana ni sahihi kwa kila hali. Hapa kuna mtu anayezungumza -- pale ambapo hakuna, \"Hakuna anayezungumza\" huamua."

msgid "the picture goes to the answer before it starts"
msgstr "picha huenda kwa jibu kabla halijaanza"

msgid "Only after a question that is not the main speaker's, when somebody else takes over at once and keeps the floor.\n\"do not go early\" means no early camera change: the picture follows the sound here as it does everywhere else."
msgstr "Tu baada ya swali lisilo la mzungumzaji mkuu, pale mtu mwingine anapochukua nafasi mara moja na kuendelea kuzungumza.\n\"usitangulie\" inamaanisha hakuna kubadili kamera mapema: picha hufuata sauti hapa kama kila mahali pengine."

msgid "Wide shot"
msgstr "Picha pana"

msgid "Wide shot %d"
msgstr "Picha pana %d"

msgid "(wide shot)"
msgstr "(picha pana)"

msgid "No speaker"
msgstr "Hakuna mzungumzaji"

msgid "Listener"
msgstr "Msikilizaji"

msgid "Alternating"
msgstr "Kwa zamu"

msgid "No camera change"
msgstr "Bila kubadili kamera"

msgid "Hold a short gap"
msgstr "Shikilia pengo fupi"

msgid "do not go early"
msgstr "usitangulie"

msgid "Answering speaker"
msgstr "Anayejibu"

msgid "  %sx away from the speaker because a shot ran longer than %s s"
msgstr "  mara %s mbali na mzungumzaji kwa sababu kipande kilidumu zaidi ya %s s"

msgid "%s is in place."
msgstr "%s imesakinishwa."

msgid "This window is still the version it started as. It can start again now and come up as that one, or you can do that yourself later."
msgstr "Dirisha hili bado ni toleo lile lililoanza nalo. Linaweza kuanza upya sasa na kufunguka kama toleo hilo, au unaweza kufanya hivyo mwenyewe baadaye."

msgid "This copy runs out of a folder of its own, so pip has nothing here to update. This installs it: %s"
msgstr "Nakala hii inaendeshwa kutoka folda yake yenyewe, kwa hiyo pip haina cha kusasisha hapa. Hiki ndicho kinachoisakinisha: %s"

msgid "Language of the window"
msgstr "Lugha ya dirisha"

msgid "A language chosen here is spoken from the next start."
msgstr "Lugha utakayochagua hapa itatumika kuanzia utakapofungua programu tena."

msgid "Restart the application"
msgstr "Anzisha upya programu"

msgid "The work can be written to a project file first."
msgstr "Kazi inaweza kuandikwa kwenye faili ya mradi kwanza."

msgid "Starting the application again brings it at once, and asks first what is to happen to the work. Leaving it alone costs nothing -- it comes at the next start."
msgstr "Kuanzisha upya programu kunaileta mara moja, na kwanza kunauliza kazi ifanywe nini. Kuiacha hivyo hakugharimu chochote -- itakuja utakapoanzisha tena."

msgid "The application is about to start again. Shall the work be written to a project file first?"
msgstr "Programu inakaribia kuanza upya. Je, kazi iandikwe kwenye faili ya mradi kwanza?"

msgid "Written, the new window opens the project again and everything stands where it stood. Not written, it comes up empty and the files have to be added afresh."
msgstr "Ikiandikwa, dirisha jipya hufungua mradi tena na kila kitu kinabaki mahali kilipokuwa. Isipoandikwa, dirisha hufunguka tupu na faili lazima ziongezwe upya."

msgid "Save and restart"
msgstr "Hifadhi na uanzishe upya"

msgid "Restart without saving"
msgstr "Anzisha upya bila kuhifadhi"

msgid "The run is still going. The window can be started again once it is finished."
msgstr "Uendeshaji bado unaendelea. Dirisha linaweza kuanzishwa upya utakapokamilika."

msgid "System language (%s)"
msgstr "Lugha ya mfumo (%s)"

msgid "A shortcut to this program was made: %s"
msgstr "Njia ya mkato ya programu hii imeundwa: %s"

msgid "No shortcut to this program was made: %s"
msgstr "Hakuna njia ya mkato ya programu hii iliyoundwa: %s"

msgid "it was written and was not there afterwards"
msgstr "iliandikwa lakini haikuwepo baadaye"

msgid "This program is running as %s and the packages installed for it are %s, so none of them can be loaded. This starts it right: %s"
msgstr "Programu hii inaendeshwa kama %s na vifurushi vilivyosakinishwa kwa ajili yake ni %s, kwa hiyo hakuna hata kimoja kinachoweza kuingizwa. Hivi ndivyo inavyoanzishwa ipasavyo: %s"

msgid "This handover carries no frame rate, so the timeline cannot be built from it. Please make the run again."
msgstr "Makabidhiano haya hayana kasi ya fremu, kwa hiyo Timeline haiwezi kujengwa kutokana nayo. Tafadhali fanya uendeshaji tena."

msgid "Cut by speaker"
msgstr "Mkato kwa mzungumzaji"

msgid "Sync only"
msgstr "Usawazishaji pekee"

msgid "Project type"
msgstr "Aina ya mradi"

msgid "No project type chosen yet."
msgstr "Bado hakuna aina ya mradi iliyochaguliwa."

msgid "What is this production to become?"
